      <p source="#source-472-498"><seg source="#source-472-498">思はずも筆はしり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-498-536"><seg source="#source-498-507">忽ちに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-507-519"><rb>画</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-519-536">は成りぬ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-536-583"><seg source="#source-536-583">この時に涙ぞくだる。われながら</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-583-617"><seg source="#source-583-617">芸の力に泣きぬるか。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-617-682"><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-617-647" corresp="#source-620-647"><seg source="#source-617-620">き</seg></hi><seg source="#source-647-682">と見れば、あさましや、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-682-735"><seg source="#source-682-697">をののきに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-697-709"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-709-712">ぞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-712-727"><rb>眩</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-727-735">む。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-735-806"><seg source="#source-735-750">むくつけき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-750-768"><rb>斑</rb><rt>まだら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768-771">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-771-789"><rb>獣</rb><rt>けもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-789-806">尾を曳きて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-806-855"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-806-821"><rb>面</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-821-855">には君をゑがきたり。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-855-905"><seg source="#source-855-864">やがて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-864-876"><rb>画</rb><rt>ゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-876-885">は炉の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-885-900"><rb>中</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-900-905">に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-905-940"><seg source="#source-905-940">燃えながら且つ泣きぬ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-940-987"><seg source="#source-940-987">ああされど、偽らざりき、わが心</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-987-1032"><seg source="#source-987-1005">思ふはげにも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1005-1017"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1017-1032">なりける。</seg></p>
    </body>
